History: earlier releases shipped src/math/ternary_matmul_lut_avx512bw.c, an
AVX-512 LUT ternary matmul ported from tommyyliu's lut_mm (https://github.com/tommyyliu/lut_mm,
originally GPL-3.0, relicensed by its author to LGPL-3.0-or-later after discussion in
https://github.com/tommyyliu/lut_mm/issues/1). That file was never called by the engine and has been
removed; no later release contains it or needs the LGPL-3.0 text. The notices that shipped with the
earlier releases are unchanged in those releases (published releases are immutable) and in this
repository's history: the commit "licence: keep the original GPL-3.0 text and record the history of the
LGPL kernel" holds the GPL-3.0 text and the pinned record of the author's agreement.
